BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:⛔ Waterloo & City: No service on Christmas Day
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261225
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261226
DTSTAMP:20261116T000000Z
UID:b01fe42e4172122e24d7@tfl-closures
CATEGORIES:Whole line closed
DESCRIPTION:⛔ Whole line closed\n\nNo service on Christmas Day\nDates as
  listed by TfL: Friday 25 December 2026\n\nTfL live status (Planned Closur
 e\, checked 19 November 2026): LONDON UNDERGROUND: Christmas Day\, 25 Dece
 mber\, no service on any line. Services resume on Boxing Day morning to a 
 revised Sunday timetable. No Night Tube services operate on Christmas Eve 
 or Boxing Day.\nTfL live status (Planned Closure\, checked 19 November 202
 6): Waterloo & City line: service operates 06:00 until 00:30\, Monday to F
 riday only. There is no service on Saturdays\, Sundays and on bank/public 
 holidays.\n\nSource: TfL planned track closures\, correct at Monday 16 Nov
 ember 2026. https://tfl.gov.uk/api/document/plannedtrackclosures.pdf?id=ac
 cc98cf-e761-47b3-a43b-3de08a097b8f&type=document\nPlans can change. Check 
 before you travel: https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/\nPowered
  by TfL Open Data\nUnofficial calendar\, not produced or endorsed by Trans
 port for London.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-BUSYSTATUS:FREE
END:VEVENT
